WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,060
Right

2
00:00:01,060 --> 00:00:04,060
Sushan said before that he picks up garbage when he has time, doesn't he?

3
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:07,060
Then can I pick it up too?

4
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,540
I really have clothes

5
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:10,540
Although a little dirty

6
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:11,540
but not important

7
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:13,540
Just take this thing to your own place

8
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:14,540
wash a little

9
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:32,900
I can wear it for everyone, why wait?

10
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:33,900
None of your business

11
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:34,900
Gui Dan appears in front of me

12
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:36,900
Otherwise, I'll beat you to death, you stinky garbage collector.

13
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:43,780
You, just wait for me

14
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:45,780
This world is rich in materials

15
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:47,780
People don't have to worry about whether they can survive.

16
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:50,820
But this person has no sense of defense at all.

17
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:53,820
A woman like this actually got drunk and passed out on the road in the middle of the night

18
00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:54,820
How dangerous is this?

19
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:56,200
Better help her
